BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventbarksbrews26boos26080-20261017@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261017T133525Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261017
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261018
SUMMARY:Barks\, Brews\, & Boos
DESCRIPTION:We have partnered with Monocacy Brewing Company to bring you an afternoon of spooky fun for your families and furbabies alike - join us for fabulous beer\, Howl-O-Ween carnival games\, a silent auction\, and an all-around beautiful fall day perusing our vendor stalls and enjoying the brewery. Each ticket includes a complimentary serving of beer\, a commemorative koozie\, an entry into our door prize raffle\, a ticket for one Howl-O-Ween carnival game\, and unlimited access to our other activities and vendors. Costumes- human and canine- are of course welcomed! Online ticket sales end October 16th\, but day-of tickets will be available at the venue and are $30. The first 100 people to buy tickets will receive a pawsome gift bag stuffed with lots of goodies! We are a totally volunteer-run organization so 100% of proceeds directly benefit our rescue animals! Visit us at awlfc.org for more details on our mission and impact.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/barks-brews-%26-boos/26080/
