DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261017
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261018
SUMMARY:Grand Opening: African American Heritage Center
DESCRIPTION:After years of dedicated planning and unwavering commitment\, the African American Resources Cultural and Heritage Society\, Inc. (AARCH) proudly announces the Grand Opening of AARCH’s African American Heritage Center in the heart of Frederick\, MD. This landmark achievement is the result of tireless research\, community collaboration\, and a shared vision to honor and preserve the rich heritage of African Americans in Frederick and beyond. There will be a ribbon cutting ceremony with local and state dignitaries\, live music and activities for the kids.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/grand-opening%3a-african-american-heritage-center/25967/
